content.p:
CAA member means a member of the CAA appointed by the Secretary of State under section 2 of the Civil Aviation Act 1982

1982 c. 16.
									;

certificate holder means the holder of a certificate issued by the CAA under Regulation (EU) 2018/1139 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 4 July 2018 on common rules in the field of civil aviation and establishing a European Union Aviation Safety Agency
EUR 2018/1139, amended by S.I. 2019/645. and Commission Regulation (EU) No 139/2014 of 12 February 2014 laying down requirements and administrative procedures related to aerodromes pursuant to Regulation (EC) No 216/2008 of the European Parliament and of the Council
EUR 2014/139, amended by S.I. 2019/645. ;

licence holder means the holder of a licence issued by the CAA under regulation 212 of the Air Navigation Order 2016

S.I. 2016/765; relevant amending instruments are S.I. 2017/1112, S.I. 2018/623, S.I. 2019/261, S.I. 2019/645, S.I. 2020/1555 and S.I. 2021/879.
									;

Regulation (EC) No 437/2003 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 27 February 2003 on statistical returns in respect of the carriage of passengers, freight and mail by air

EUR 2003/437, as amended by S.I. 2019/646.
								;

Commission Regulation (EC) No 1358/2003 of 31 July 2003 implementing Regulation (EC) No 437/2003 of the European Parliament and of the Council on statistical returns in respect of the carriage of passengers, freight and mail by air and amending Annexes I and II thereto

EUR 2003/1358, as amended by S.I. 2019/646.
								;

Commission Regulation (EU) No 546/2005 of 8 April 2005 adapting Regulation (EC) No 437/2003 of the European Parliament and of the Council as regards the allocation of reporting-country codes and amending Commission Regulation (EC) No 1358/2003 as regards the updating of the list of Community airports

EUR 2005/546.
								;

Commission Regulation (EC) No 158/2007 of 16 February 2007 amending Commission Regulation (EC) No 1358/2003 as regards the list of community airports

EUR 2007/158.
								;
